  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rehabilitation of the WAEMU CU18 Ghana - Benin Border Road Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">12. The project&apos;s overall objective is to stimulate economic activities, reduce transport costs, improve sub-regional integration, and enhance security and safety along the direct project area.
13. Specifically, the project aims to: 
&#xF0FC; improve economic activity in the project implementation areas,
&#xF0FC; reduce the cost of transporting people and goods,
&#xF0FC; reduce travel time,
&#xF0FC; improve the living conditions of the populations in the project area of influence (ZIP),
&#xF0FC; facilitate access to socio-economic centers in the project implementation areas,
&#xF0FC; reduce vehicle operating costs,
&#xF0FC; reduce the number of traffic accidents,
&#xF0FC; improve the immediate environment and the living conditions of the population in the project area,
&#xF0FC; improve comfort in the corridor,
&#xF0FC; contribute to the reduction of diseases and mortality rates, and
&#xF0FC; increase the safety of people and property.</narrative>
  </description>
